    [3310001] = {
        id = 3310001,
        text = "1. Hunter's Pursuit unlocks at Club Lv.4. Members with 200 or more Club Contribution can participate after joining the club for more than 48hr.",
        minipack = 0,
    },
    [3310003] = {
        id = 3310003,
        text = "3. In the preparation phase, members can challenge 3 weakness instance of the club boss solo 2 times a day. (Chances are shared by 3 instance and reset at 6:00 daily)",
        minipack = 0,
    },
    [3310005] = {
        id = 3310005,
        text = "5. In the challenge phase, club members can team-up to challenge club bosses. Club Bosses have 40 levels (Each level is a round). Defeat a boss then the boss of one lever higher will appear. The initial boss level of each cycle is decided by the highest boss level in the last cycle (minus 5 levels)",
        minipack = 0,
    },
    [471106] = {
        id = 471106,
        text = "Glaubenskosten von # -2",
        minipack = 0,
    },
    [3310009] = {
        id = 3310009,
        text = "9. There are 2 kinds of battle rewards: 1st kill reward and last-hit reward. After killing a boss for the 1st time, you can claim 1st kill reward before the next cycle starts. When a cycle ends, club members will get rewards for the highest-level boss defeated plus bosses 1 and 2 levels below. These rewards can be claimed before the challenge phase of next cycle starts. If not claimed in time, all rewards will disappear forever.",
        minipack = 0,
    },
    [3310011] = {
        id = 3310011,
        text = "11. Club honor is connected to the club leaderboard. More will be revealed soon. Stay tuned!",
        minipack = 0,
    },
    [3310013] = {
        id = 3310013,
        text = "13. The DMG Proportion Reward requires calculation of final Individual DMG and total DMG dealt by all Club members, thus will be issued a bit late, claiming time is from next Monday 8:00 am until the next challenge period begins. Unclaimed DMG Proportion Reward will not be sent",
        minipack = 0,
    },
