        text = "5. Officer system unlocks at Lv.10. When Covenanter Level is between Lv.10-60, it is possible to search for an instructor. Each Covenanter can only complete one Trial Quest in all life. After Covenanter Level exceeds 60, you can search for student instead of instructor.",
