        text = "9. Trial Quest: Trial Quest is a student quest that requires assistance from instructor. Each student can only complete it once, and quest progress is synced between the two; If tutorship is cancelled, instructor and student can claim rewards for already completed progress. After wards, if the student finds a new instructor, the completed progress remains, and student with level >60 cannot search instructor or refresh trial quest;",
