    [15011023] = {
        id = 15011023,
        text = "If you find that any personal information provided to us is incorrect, incomplete or requires update, you can submit a request for correction with the methods provided in this \"Privacy Policy\". \n2.1 For personal information such as avatar and nickname, there are options for you to make corrections/modifications in game directly in the corresponding pages. \n2.2 For any difficulty you encounter in the process of exercising the above mentioned rights, or other rights that may not be provided to you with online correction/modification services at present, you can contact us with the methods mentioned in this \"Privacy Policy\" and request us to correct or modify your data. After verification of your identity and confirming such action does not affect the objectivity and accuracy of the information, we will correct or modify the erroneous or incomplete information, unless otherwise stipulated by laws and regulations. However, for security and identification reasons, you may not be able to modify some information submitted at registration (e.g. real name and ID number).\n",
